<title>PERU: RESEARCH ALERT - Cementos Norte cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cementos Norte cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings analyst Hector Castillo has cut his rating for Peruvian cement company Cementos Norte Pacasmayo SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- In an April 22 report, he said he made the downgrade because of recent price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 0.03 sol to 4.30 soles in Lima.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
